  "hints": [
    "The first gate needs the dark pad held. The second gate and the lift run on the countdown of the pad beside them.",
    "LAB-LIGHTS and ROUTE-POWER cannot run together (40 and 50 is more than 60). Light the nook to record, then swap before you launch.",
    "Record right three times, then up. After launch go right three times, wait, go right two more times, then down three times."
